{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集，陳星妤（Yvette）與心儀對象關經翰（Oswald）迎來單獨約會，本 …</p><p></p>\n<p>戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集，陳星妤（Yvette）與心儀對象關經翰（Oswald）迎來單獨約會，本應浪漫的水族館晚餐，Yvette卻因目睹Oswald與梁超怡互動而打翻醋罈，更重提舊愛陰影，即場對Oswald進行「靈魂拷問」，氣氛急轉直下！面對Yvette的連環追擊，Oswald如何拆解？\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤直擊Oswald與梁超怡互動 打翻醋罈靈魂拷問</h2>\n<p>在水族館的浪漫晚餐中，陳星妤（Yvette）突然向關經翰（Oswald）發動攻勢，原來她在早前的遊戲中，直擊Oswald與另一位參賽者梁超怡傾偈傾到笑哈哈，Oswald更曾將黑超借給超怡戴，令Yvette大感不悅。為了確認Oswald的心意，Yvette決定攤牌，更直球式發問：「但如果超怡冇走到你諗住點？」這突如其來的質問讓Oswald措手不及，被嚇至差點將口中的水噴出，場面一度陷入尷尬。</p>\n<h2>Oswald一杯水化解危機 反客為主質問與Kyle關係</h2>\n<p>面對陳星妤（Yvette）的尖銳問題，身經百戰的關經翰（Oswald）並非省油的燈，他巧妙地利用枱上的一杯水成功轉移視線，化解危機，更讓Yvette笑著收場。未幾，Oswald隨即以「不如我問番你」進行反擊，將矛頭直指Yvette與認識十多年的好友Kyle的關係，連環發問：「你同佢識咗十幾年，冇預過一齊咩？」、「你覺得你同 Kyle 係咪仲有機會一齊？」連串尖銳問題令Yvette一度嘟起嘴巴，無法招架。\n</p>\n<h2>陳星妤揭前度陰影缺安全感 Oswald大派定心丸</h2>\n<p>原來陳星妤（Yvette）的強勢拷問，源於過往情傷帶來的心理陰影。她坦言前度男友是個愛玩的人，令她極度缺乏安全感：「我嗰時 Ex 好鍾意去玩，可能真係安全感嘅問題，我心底裏好想避免我過往同類型嘅傷害再發生。」她亦擔心身為健身教練的Oswald會接觸大量女性。在強攻過後，Oswald不忘向Yvette大派定心丸，認真表示：「I hope I make it clear， at least（意指我對你有意思）我真係上嚟答你問題嗰吓！」事後更大讚Yvette「好 Brave」、「好主動」兼「有 Loyalty」。\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱議高手過招：呢啲對話先係戲肉！</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，兩人的高段位攻防戰引發網民熱烈討論，紛紛讚嘆對話精彩。有網民留言指：「Yvette問得好直接，Oswald又拆得好靚，高手過招！」、「睇到Oswald反問Kyle嗰度好緊張，以為會反面！」、「陳星妤好勇敢，肯講自己嘅不安感，好真實。」、「Oswald派定心丸嗰下好冧，呢對有得發展！」、「梁超怡真係最強第三者，走咗都仲有影響力！」。</p>\n<p>（圖片來源：TVB）</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_8044697856af6e01f026a0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_8044697856af6e01f026a0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16038706496af6e02fb198c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16038706496af6e02fb198c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7021539756af6e035b8f02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7021539756af6e035b8f02.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10407362936af6e0452dabc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_10407362936af6e0452dabc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_8925727116af6e07f9ed41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/31_8925727116af6e07f9ed41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_12816464276af6e08917ae8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_12816464276af6e08917ae8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15247759736af6dfcb91b2d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15247759736af6dfcb91b2d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13559794606af6dfcf69e3d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13559794606af6dfcf69e3d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10419930666af6dfd56463b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 陳星妤 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_10419930666af6dfd56463b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_17453622156af6dfd95f563.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_17453622156af6dfd95f563.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%97%9c%e7%b6%93%e7%bf%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">關經翰</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%98%9f%e5%a6%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳星妤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542317\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 13 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.407786+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1580,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:05:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:55:14.620068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:13.589144+00:00","content_hash":"6445f47d2ac118cb8b4b29bbb388eb592a279f5520c6acad2aaf5bfd929ac46c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}